#Requires -Version 7.0
Set-StrictMode -Off
<#
.SYNOPSIS
  Local operations for UCKK Ops Console.

.DESCRIPTION
  This module manages local-only actions:

    - verify local paths;
    - sync source code to local Moodle runtime;
    - run local Moodle upgrades when plugin versions change;
    - purge local Moodle caches;
    - start local Moodle from the configured local URL and runtime folder;
    - open local Moodle and each public façade;
    - test local pages and the UCKK/UCC/Math switcher.

  Contract:
    - This module must not modify the server.
    - This module must not write to the server Moodle database.
    - This module must not run recovery tools.
    - This module must not use hardcoded project paths.
    - All paths and URLs must come from configuration.
    - Public functions must return ActionResult-compatible objects.
#>

